Task-Name: amerika-desktop-full
Task-Description: Amerika OS desktop, full
Task-Long-Description: Everything in amerika-desktop plus the optional applications most people
 want on a daily-driver machine: an offline office suite (LibreOffice, next to Amerika
 Office), media players and viewers, graphics tools and a developer toolbox. Everything beyond
 amerika-desktop is a Recommends, so single applications can be removed without removing this package.
Section: metapackages

Depends:
 * amerika-desktop
 * amerika-login
 * amerika-boot
 * amerika-doc

Recommends:
 # Office suite choice: Amerika Office (offline and hosted, from amerika-desktop) or the offline LibreOffice below.
 * libreoffice-writer
 * libreoffice-calc
 * libreoffice-impress
 * libreoffice-gtk3
 * hunspell-en-us
 # Media
 * vlc
 * showtime
 * loupe
 * papers
 * rhythmbox
 * snapshot
 # Graphics
 * gimp
 * inkscape
 # Everyday tools
 * file-roller
 * gnome-system-monitor
 * baobab
 * transmission-gtk
 * simple-scan
 # Development tools
 * git
 * build-essential
 * cmake
 * python3-venv
 * python3-pip
 * nodejs
 * npm
 * neovim
 * jq
 * ripgrep
 * shellcheck
 * gh
 * tmux
